  "title": "Umami Springy Indian Fish Dumplings",
  "description": "A pescatarian-friendly Andhra dish featuring sea salt and dum, made with fish and steamed in a bamboo steamer to create a springy and energizing meal.",
  "cuisine": "Indian",
  "diet": [
